## Reference Implementations

| Language | Crate / File          | Notes                    |
|----------|-----------------------|--------------------------|
| Rust     | `ptiles-v7/`          | Schema + reader library  |

### Dependencies

- **h3**: Hexagonal spatial indexing (Uber H3 library)
- **zstd**: Compression with trained dictionary
- **thiserror**: Error handling
